st, npm tarball, Chrome CRX, VSIX\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"'Package Deal' pun read as software packages. Separate fmts: nupkg (alias nuget): zip with `*.nuspec` (XML ns varies) id, version, authors, description, dependencies (JSON id@range), tags; `[Content_Types].xml` + `_rels/.rels` + `package/s\n  {\"id\": \"synthesis-siblings\", \"concept\": \"Cross-file md5/sha1/size ordering, duplicates, timeline\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"note\", \"detail\": \"lib.meta.synthesis.digest_order(question, get_bytes, algo) answered sha256 order D15-D20 (Files = note + 2 re-picked kit members + the day's new member; order re-rolls per Mastery set; D20 solver carried the dispatch forward -> timed first try; the 409 pre-fetch body listed \n  {\"id\": \"gate-allowlist-dfir-libs\", \"concept\": \"Prebuild gate refuses installed DFIR libs\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"note\", \"detail\": \"hctf/prebuild.py ALLOWED_IMPORTS lacks Evtx, regipy, olefile, oletools, dnfile, LnkParse3, lief, cryptography, asn1crypto, dpkt, PIL, sqlite3, wave, ordlookup. Targets evtx-records (python-evtx) and regf-values (regipy) as written will fail the gate exactly like pe-debug-rich-import\n  {\"id\": \"python-pyinstaller-zipapp\", \"concept\": \"Python frozen/runnable packages: PyInstaller CArchive TOC, zipapp .pyz, py2exe/Nuitka markers, pyc versions\", \"priority\": 2, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"fmt pyinstaller (aliases pyi, python_frozen) on PE/ELF/Mach-O: find cookie `MEI\\\\x0c\\\\x0b\\\\x0a\\\\x0b\\\\x0e` (last occurrence); 2.1+ cookie = magic 8 B, pkg_len u32 BE, toc_offset u32 BE, toc_len u32 BE, pyvers u32 \n  {\"id\": \"oci-container-image\", \"concept\": \"Container images: docker-save tarballs and OCI image layouts (Entrypoint/Cmd = where execution begins)\", \"priority\": 2, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"fmt oci (aliases docker, container, image_tar). tarfile over the member: docker-save has `manifest.json` = [{Config, RepoTag